ation\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sex-stratified logistic regression models produced adjusted prevalence ratios (APRs)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Models controlled for race/ethnicity and grade\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"were limited to students who had ever had sexual intercourse\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Differences in risk behavior prevalence between sexual minority youth subgroups were tested using linear contrast t-tests\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistical tests were considered significant if p<0.05 or 95% CIs did not include 1.0\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}